    "parameters": {
      "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Create ONE new transparent full-body HD2 tactical-map sprite of 索爾 (Sol/Thor) from Flame Dragon Knights 2. Reference image 1 is the USER-APPROVED HD2 style: use ONLY the small blue-haired hero standing in the CENTRAL battlefield as the costume, elevated three-quarter camera, chibi proportions and smooth hand-painted style reference. Do not copy the tall side poster figure. Reference image 2 is this character's OWN original DATO portrait. Reference image 3 is his OWN HD face portrait. Preserve his blue-black long hair, RED forehead band, firm straight nose, serious masculine eyebrows and angular young adult male face. His hair is loose as in his own portraits, no invented braid or tied ponytail. Full body standing in a calm alert idle, viewed from above at the same elevated three-quarter angle as the central battlefield reference, facing toward the lower right. His head is about 40 percent of his full body height, following the approved HD2 central small character, with short legs and a readable but not baby-like face. Preserve the blue/navy original hero clothing, small gold trim, red inner collar, brown boots and gloves, belt, and ONE straight steel sword held in his right hand pointing gently forward and down. Follow the CENTRAL small hero's outfit; no extra shield, extra cape, horns or new equipment. Both boots and the full sword must be visible with clear separation of arms and legs. Soft painted daylight, clean silhouette readable at 144 to 192 pixels high, subtle detail, no pixel art and no plastic 3D render. Center one complete character with comfortable transparent margins on every side. Truly transparent RGBA background, no scenery, no ground tile, no pedestal, no text, no UI, no second character, no duplicated sword, no watermark. This is a draft for an isolated HD2 presentation prototype, not a combat or walking frame.",
